{"n": 456, "w": 1005, "h": 768, "img": "456.webp", "text": "26-41\n\nBend propeller shaft down and pull out\nof centering pin on the transmission.\nHt applicable, push back propeller shaft\non the slide completely.\n\nInstallation:\nPropeller shaft was balanced as an\nassembly and can only be replaced as\n\nJ\n\nImportant\nDon't allow the propeller shaft to bear\non the connecting pipe on the fuel tank.\n\nimportant!\n\nDon’t allow the propeller shaft to fall\nInto the joints. This would damage the\nrubber cover especially on a constant\nvelocity joint.\n\nInstallation:\n\nCheck center, lubricating with Molykote\nLongterm 2 If necessary.\n\nReplace a damaged center.", "words": [["26-41", 0.4632, 0.0326, 0.5318, 0.0579], ["Bend", 0.2746, 0.0768, 0.302, 0.0885], ["propeller", 0.307, 0.0755, 0.3537, 0.0911], ["shaft", 0.3577, 0.0742, 0.3841, 0.0872], ["down", 0.3881, 0.0742, 0.4174, 0.0859], ["and", 0.4204, 0.0742, 0.4408, 0.0846], ["pull", 0.4438, 0.0729, 0.4642, 0.0872], ["out", 0.4672, 0.0729, 0.4846, 0.0833], ["of", 0.2746, 0.0938, 0.2846, 0.1055], ["centering", 0.2886, 0.0924, 0.3393, 0.1074], ["pin", 0.3433, 0.0911, 0.3597, 0.1055], ["on", 0.3627, 0.0924, 0.3771, 0.1029], ["the", 0.3811, 0.0911, 0.397, 0.1029], ["transmission.", 0.401, 0.0885, 0.4731, 0.1016], ["Ht", 0.2746, 0.11, 0.2816, 0.1217], ["applicable,", 0.2846, 0.1087, 0.3433, 0.1243], ["push", 0.3473, 0.1087, 0.3736, 0.123], ["back", 0.3771, 0.1074, 0.402, 0.1191], ["propeller", 0.4065, 0.1055, 0.4537, 0.1217], ["shaft", 0.4572, 0.1016, 0.4831, 0.1165], ["on", 0.2746, 0.1283, 0.2886, 0.1387], ["the", 0.2925, 0.1257, 0.309, 0.1374], ["slide", 0.3129, 0.1257, 0.3383, 0.1374], ["completely.", 0.3413, 0.123, 0.403, 0.1387], ["Installation:", 0.2766, 0.1589, 0.3333, 0.1706], ["Propeller", 0.2766, 0.1732, 0.4642, 0.1908], ["shaft", 0.3308, 0.1706, 0.3577, 0.1934], ["was", 0.3612, 0.1706, 0.3781, 0.1934], ["balanced", 0.3831, 0.1706, 0.4289, 0.1934], ["as", 0.4338, 0.1706, 0.4463, 0.1934], ["an", 0.4512, 0.17